The risk tolerance questionnaire
Institutional Risk Tolerance Assessment — Carina Voss
This questionnaire is designed to assess Carina Voss's risk tolerance and investment preferences to help
construct an appropriate investment portfolio. Responses will be used to determine a recommended asset
allocation strategy.
