n Below $1,000,000
Assets Under Consideration: $1,200,000
WHAT IS THE CLIENT'S TIME HORIZON?
n 0–4 Years (3 points)
n 5–10 Years (6 points)
n 11–20 Years (9 points)
n 20 Years + (12 points)
Note: Carina indicated she may retire early and anticipates needing portfolio income within 7–8 years.
WHAT IS THE CLIENT'S PRIMARY INVESTMENT OBJECTIVE?
n Income (3 points)
