WHAT IS THE CLIENT'S OVERALL INVESTMENT APPROACH?
n Prefers a relative level of stability in the overall portfolio (3 points)
n Prefers to slightly increase investment value while minimizing the potential for loss of principal (6
points)
n Prefers moderate investment growth with moderate to high levels of risk and principal fluctuations (9
points)
n Prefers meaningful investment growth with moderate to high levels of risk and principal fluctuations (12
